sPLHxC9_twiA6wOYA-sDmAM\"/><figcaption>勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211026/529649062707335168943657.jpeg/MqpcZ2v1ggLp9MMrJC-H2a38mI4QvDsub1Wh_W9Vof0\"/><figcaption>勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211026/529649065362460672561073.jpeg/9kOtwoahDmwvs59tYX9xj4Xfn-2zLih5ik-9BYpPvQU\"/><figcaption>勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211026/529649067707207680456879.jpeg/zSha8GzGr4YhS5vXVd_7_P9gBX6fZcILFx2v4Bcdr-A\"/><figcaption>勁呀！（安以軒FB照片）</figcaption></figure><p>霍正奇輕鬆應付《針線緣》3妻妾　體力堪比魔鬼班長：小事情</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T01:41:05.680123+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1558,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}